Cell[TextData[{
 "Now coeffsSymCorrected is the approx solution with ",
 StyleBox["exact",
  FontWeight->"Bold",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " symmetry, stored as rational Chebychev coefficients.\n\nWe now use it to \
compute the error in the M-A equation -- now using 1000 digit reals"
